{"acceptance_length": 7.17741935483871, "acceptance_lengths": [4, 7, 11, 9, 4, 2, 6, 8, 13, 6, 3, 15, 4, 11, 16, 7, 3, 16, 2, 3, 1, 16, 16, 16, 10, 16, 1, 1, 3, 4, 3, 3, 3, 1, 8, 5, 1, 1, 3, 2, 10, 3, 16, 4, 15, 16, 9, 16, 3, 4, 1, 2, 2, 2, 14, 16, 8, 2, 15, 9, 10, 4], "accepted_draft_lengths": [3, 6, 10, 8, 3, 1, 5, 7, 12, 5, 2, 14, 3, 10, 15, 6, 2, 15, 1, 2, 0, 15, 15, 15, 9, 15, 0, 0, 2, 3, 2, 2, 2, 0, 7, 4, 0, 0, 2, 1, 9, 2, 15, 3, 14, 15, 8, 15, 2, 3, 0, 1, 1, 1, 13, 15, 7, 1, 14, 8, 9, 3], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 21115004416, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 21114999296, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "Let's break down the problem step by step to find **Mr. Tan's net proceeds** from selling the house.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 1: Selling Price of the House**\nThe selling price of the house is:\n\n$$\n\\$400{,}000\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 2: Transfer Fees**\nTransfer fees are **3%** of the selling price:\n\n$$\n\\text{Transfer Fees} = 3\\% \\times 400{,}000 = 0.03 \\times 400{,}000 = \\$12{,}000\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Brokerage Fee**\nBrokerage fee is **5%** of the selling price:\n\n$$\n\\text{Brokerage Fee} = 5\\% \\times 400{,}000 = 0.05 \\times 400{,}000 = \\$20{,}000\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 4: Loan Repayment**\nHe also paid **\\$250,000** to settle the remaining loan amount.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 5: Total Expenses**\nNow, add up all the expenses:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total Expenses} = \\text{Transfer Fees} + \\text{Brokerage Fee} + \\text{Loan Repayment}\n$$\n$$\n= 12{,}000 + 20{,}000 + 250{,}000 = \\$282{,}000\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 6: Net Proceeds**\nNet proceeds are the **selling price minus total expenses**:\n\n$$\n\\text{Net Proceeds} = 400{,}000 - 282{,}000 = \\boxed{\\$118{,}000}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n$$\n\\boxed{\\$118{,}000}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 2.276125783100724, "draft_calls": 62, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 109, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "f5084dfef9e46b62ae8bd3e603e19b786a76cdf9ae432854730a47c849737fa